o {3} stacks of <color=Highlight><te href=850013>Electro Flare</te></color>.\n- <color=Highlight>Fleeting Thunder</color> will be removed when the target leaves the designated range around Hsin.\nExiting the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state or switching Resonance Mode removes the aforementioned effects.",
