   "Skill_1006106_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>) or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color> (when in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>).\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Intro Skill - Illumining Form: Manifold Unison</color></size>\nThis skill becomes available while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. Attack the target, dealing greater <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.",
